## Interviewee

SAGOJO Inc.
CEO : Takuya Shin

## A Community to Connect Travelers, Companies and Local Governments through Work: SAGOJO

### Q.What is SAGOJO?

SAGOJO(https://www.sagojo.link/)is “SUGOI Travelers Recruitment Website,” where travelers can receive rewards from companies by doing some “Work” while they are travelling in Japan and abroad.

As of January 2019, more than 13,000 travelers have registered and we introduce the most suitable traveler to the job offer of a company or a local government. 

Most of our registered travelers want to have lives with moving, and to work while traveling around. Wehave roughly 3 types of community members.

First type is freelancers. Freelancers who want to travel and work not only in Tokyo but also in rural areas in Japan and overseas register for SAGOJO to get job offers.

Second type is those who want to make use of their skills since their employer companies have allowed them to have secondary job.

Third type is travelers who are exactly traveling domestically and abroad now. Some have quitted their job to become backpackers, etc.

