## Evaluate and Visualize the Values of Community Members’ Activities

### Q.How would you like to develop SAGOJO from now on?

#### Visualize and Evaluate Information Other than Registered Profiles

As we have high ratio of job seekers to job offers, users fill in very detailed profile information. However, a lot of information about their skills will be revealed after they actually do their job. How to visualize those skillsis one of our challenges from now on.

Specifically, how much specialized skills they have, such as article writing and photo shooting, and also their characteristics other than skills such as their communication ability, motivation and diligence, etc. We also want to focus on their thoughts, such as how they can cooperate and work together with us, not like “I want to earn money without doing hard work”.

#### Offer Chances to Skill Up

There are some users who don’t have enough skills to earn a lot. However, we want to support and evaluate those who are passionate. We need to consider what SAGOJO can do for those users. That is another challenge for us.

For example, if they can learn skills in SAGOJO, and they will be introduced some work connected to their next step, more users can do more work related to traveling.

## Revitalize People’s Opportunities by Offering Work with Rewards Other than “YEN”

### Q.What would you like to realize by using the original Community Currency “SAGOJO Coin”?

#### Make Many People Work in Collaboration and Realize the Revitalization of People’s Opportunities

For many traveler members, we will provide work with rewards other than “YEN,” and give them SAGOJO Coin or other things as remuneration. It can create new world view for more travelers than ever to work in collaboration.

Now we’re thinking to prepare something to make traveling more enjoyable, such as accommodation, special traveling experiences, or easy transportation available with SAGOJO Coin.

For example, if you are a performer, you can hold an event with local people of your travel destination. If you are good at cooking, you can use kitchen and provide some dishes. We want to offer these kind of job (work) opportunities for travelers.

## Prove that “Traveling is Valuable” through SAGOJO Coin

### Q.What is your future vision of SAGOJO?

#### Visualize that Traveling is Beneficial for a Society, not Self-Complacency

I always want to prove for those who don’t like traveling that traveling is “Beneficial for a society” and not self-complacent.

Travelers say that traveling is great, valuable and that it makes you mature. However, for those who don’t like traveling, it seems an “Escape” from what they should be. Perhaps they may think “traveling means playing.” Thus, we need to explain persuasively how valuable traveling is so that more people can choose to travel with no doubt. And we hope to realize it with SAGOJO Coin. For example, it will be interestingif we can visualize “how valuable your travel is for the society, how it works for other people.”

## Aiming for a Community where SAGOJO and Users will Progress with the Same Goal

Our current users are not “clients” but our tribe or partners to expand the awareness of the society that “Travelers are Great (SUGOI).” And we aim to realize the world view that traveling is valuable.

Now we have 13,000 users, but even if it increases to 100,000, or to 1 million, we’d like to work in collaboration with all users to “increase the values of travelers.”
